# Stop Cold's "Enchant artifact or creature" (CR 303.4a, 115.1): at Bot2's end step Bot2 controls a Crusade (an enchantment,
# refused as the Aura's target - the other four mana are there to pay for it) and a Mox Jet (an artifact that is not a creature,
# accepted). The Mox is tapped by the enters trigger and loses its mana ability (CR 613.1f), and it stays tapped through Bot2's
# untap step on turn 4 (CR 502.3), so it makes no mana then.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Stop Cold
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Crusade
Mox Jet
Island x20

